  "description": "💼✨ Lucyberry.SQLite is your super cute, chubby-chic library 🍒📦 for all things SQLite! 🌸💕 It makes database interactions smoother than berry cream 🍓💖 and keeps your data persistence as reliable as your favorite berry-scented diary. 🍒💼\n\n      🍓 What’s inside the cherry basket?\n      - 💖 Seamless SQLite database connections.\n      - 🍒 Easy schema initialization — set up like a boss-babe! 💼✨\n      - 🌸 CRUD operations? Oh-so-berry efficient! 🍓💅\n\n      Whether you're building apps or just sprinkling some berry magic 💖🍒 into your data layers, **Lucyberry.SQLite** is here to save the day — cute, robust, and oh-so-chic! 🎀📦",
